"Active CORE deputies: <strong>%(n)s</strong> (four-eyes approval needs at "
"least %(m)s)."
msgstr ""
"Aktívni zástupcovia CORE: <strong>%(n)s</strong> (schvaľovanie štyrmi očami "
"potrebuje aspoň %(m)s)."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:11
