msgstr "Povoliť nastavenia"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:37
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:52
msgid "Remove / replace"
msgstr "Odobrať / vymeniť"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:48
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With four-eyes approval on, at least %(min_core)s CORE deputies must stay: "
"then choose a replacement – the current deputy stays until the replacement "
"accepts."
msgstr ""
"Pri zapnutom schvaľovaní štyrmi očami musia ostať aspoň %(min_core)s "
"zástupcovia CORE: vtedy vyberte náhradu – súčasný zástupca ostáva, kým "
"náhrada neprijme."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:53
msgid "No CORE deputies. Only the master (superusers) manages PINs."
msgstr ""
"Žiadni zástupcovia CORE. PINy spravuje iba master (superpoužívatelia)."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:70
msgid "Invite a CORE deputy"
msgstr "Pozvať zástupcu CORE"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:84
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Ako to funguje"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:87
msgid ""
"The invited user gets an e-mail with a link and a code. The role starts only"
" after they accept it with the code, their PIN and 2FA (they set them up "
"first if needed)."
msgstr ""
"Pozvaný dostane e-mail s odkazom a kódom. Rola začne platiť, až keď ju "
"prijme kódom, svojím PINom a 2FA (ak ich nemá, najprv si ich nastaví)."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:88
msgid ""
"CORE deputies see all users and departments after confirming with their PIN "
"+ 2FA, create departments and appoint their heads."
msgstr ""
"Zástupcovia CORE vidia všetkých používateľov a oddelenia po potvrdení PINom "
"+ 2FA, zakladajú oddelenia a určujú ich správcov."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:89
msgid "They cannot manage the master or other CORE deputies."
msgstr "Nemôžu zasahovať do mastera ani iných zástupcov CORE."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:90
msgid ""
"A deputy can resign under My roles; below the minimum the role stays until a"
" replacement accepts."
msgstr ""
"Zástupca sa môže vzdať v Moje roly; pod minimom rola platí, kým náhrada "
"neprijme."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/delegates.html:91
msgid ""
"Switching four-eyes approval off ends the CORE delegation (only possible "
"when no department exists)."
msgstr ""
"Vypnutie schvaľovania štyrmi očami ukončí delegovanie CORE (iba ak "
"neexistuje žiadne oddelenie)."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:4
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/departments.html:35
