msgstr "ste delegát"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:14
msgid "Manage PINs of the members"
msgstr "Spravovať PINy členov"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:16
msgid ""
"Dissolve this department? All its roles end and the members are informed."
msgstr ""
"Zrušiť toto oddelenie? Všetky jeho roly skončia a členovia dostanú "
"informáciu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:17
msgid "Dissolve"
msgstr "Zrušiť"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:25
msgid "Head and delegates"
msgstr "Správca a delegáti"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:26
msgid ""
"The department has no active head – CORE manages it until a head accepts the"
" invitation."
msgstr ""
"Oddelenie nemá aktívneho správcu – spravuje ho CORE, kým správca neprijme "
"pozvánku."

