msgstr "Pozvať delegáta"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:160
msgid "Appoint the head first, then the delegates."
msgstr "Najprv určte správcu, potom delegátov."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:161
msgid ""
"As a delegate you need a second delegate (or the head / CORE) who confirms "
"the invitation."
msgstr ""
"Ako delegát potrebujete druhého delegáta (alebo správcu / CORE), ktorý "
"pozvánku potvrdí."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:174
msgid "Temporary hand-over of the head"
msgstr "Dočasné odovzdanie správcu"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:176
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The head is not available? Two delegates together can hand the head's rights"
" over for at most %(max_days)s days – a second delegate confirms."
msgstr ""
"Správca nie je dostupný? Dvaja delegáti spolu môžu jeho práva odovzdať "
"najviac na %(max_days)s dní – druhý delegát potvrdí."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/department.html:176
msgid ""
"E.g. holiday or illness. The whole department is informed; after the date "
"the rights return automatically."
msgstr ""
"Napr. dovolenka alebo choroba. Celé oddelenie dostane informáciu; po dátume "
"sa práva vrátia automaticky."

