msgid "Rights to grant"
msgstr "Práva na udelenie"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:36
msgid ""
"Granting protects this object type, if it is not protected yet, and creates "
"the group. Appoint the owners afterwards. Until then only the protection "
"keepers and the members of the group see it."
msgstr ""
"Udelenie začne chrániť tento typ objektu, ak ešte nie je chránený, a vytvorí"
